        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "clar.2026-09-flu-vaccine-causes-flu",
        "type": "clarification",
        "title": "網傳「打流感疫苗會得流感、長輩打完會死」並非事實",
        "summary": "公費流感疫苗是不活化疫苗，不會因接種而得流感；常見反應為注射部位疼痛與輕微發燒，長者流感重症風險遠高於疫苗風險。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/factcheck/#clar.2026-09-flu-vaccine-causes-flu",
        "path": "/factcheck/#clar.2026-09-flu-vaccine-causes-flu",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-10",
        "owner": "unit.pr",
        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "news.2026-09-10-clarify-flu-vaccine-death",
        "type": "news",
        "title": "澄清：網傳「打流感疫苗會得流感、長輩打完會死」並非事實",
        "summary": "網傳打流感疫苗會得流感、長輩打完會死並非事實。公費流感疫苗為不活化疫苗，不會引起流感；常見副作用為注射部位疼痛與輕微發燒。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/news/2026-09-10-clarify-flu-vaccine-death/",
        "path": "/news/2026-09-10-clarify-flu-vaccine-death/",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-10",
        "owner": "unit.pr",
        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "clar.2026-03-covid-isolation-7-days",
        "type": "clarification",
        "title": "網傳「確診新冠要居家隔離 7 天，同住家人也要隔離」為舊規定",
        "summary": "新冠確診隔離與同住家人檢疫已於 2023-03-20 取消；現行為有症狀戴口罩、生病在家休息，高風險者儘早就醫。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/factcheck/#clar.2026-03-covid-isolation-7-days",
        "path": "/factcheck/#clar.2026-03-covid-isolation-7-days",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-05",
        "owner": "unit.pr",
        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "clar.2025-07-dengue-spraying-poison",
        "type": "clarification",
        "title": "網傳「登革熱噴藥會毒死人、可以拒絕開門」為錯誤訊息",
        "summary": "登革熱防治用藥經核准並依規定稀釋，噴藥前會通知住戶暫離；配合防治是法定義務，清除積水才是根本。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/factcheck/#clar.2025-07-dengue-spraying-poison",
        "path": "/factcheck/#clar.2025-07-dengue-spraying-poison",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-07-10",
        "owner": "unit.pr",
        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "clar.2026-01-vinegar-saltwater-flu",
        "type": "clarification",
        "title": "網傳「燻白醋、喝鹽水可以殺死流感病毒」沒有科學根據",
        "summary": "燻白醋、喝鹽水無法殺死流感病毒，燻醋可能刺激呼吸道；預防流感最有效的是每年接種疫苗並勤洗手。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/factcheck/#clar.2026-01-vinegar-saltwater-flu",
        "path": "/factcheck/#clar.2026-01-vinegar-saltwater-flu",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-07-01",
        "owner": "unit.pr",
        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "clar.2026-05-mmr-all-adults",
        "type": "clarification",
        "title": "網傳「所有成人都要再補打一劑 MMR」部分正確",
        "summary": "並非所有成人都要補打 MMR；1966 年（含）以後出生、不具免疫力且前往流行地區者，出國前 2–4 週評估自費接種。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/factcheck/#clar.2026-05-mmr-all-adults",
        "path": "/factcheck/#clar.2026-05-mmr-all-adults",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
        "owner": "unit.pr",
        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "faq.rumor-mmr-autism",
        "type": "faq",
        "title": "MMR 疫苗會造成自閉症嗎？",
        "summary": "MMR 疫苗不會造成自閉症；該說法源自已撤稿的 1998 年論文，多國大型研究均證實兩者無關聯。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/faq/rumor-mmr-autism/",
        "path": "/faq/rumor-mmr-autism/",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
        "owner": "unit.acute-infectious",
        "ownerName": "急性傳染病組",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "clar.2026-04-enterovirus-only-kids",
        "type": "clarification",
        "title": "網傳「腸病毒只有小孩會得，大人不用擔心」部分正確",
        "summary": "腸病毒重症以 5 歲以下幼兒為主，但成人也會感染且常無症狀，可能傳給幼兒；大人回家應先洗手換衣。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/factcheck/#clar.2026-04-enterovirus-only-kids",
        "path": "/factcheck/#clar.2026-04-enterovirus-only-kids",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-04-22",
        "owner": "unit.pr",
        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "news.2025-07-15-clarify-dengue-spray",
        "type": "news",
        "title": "澄清：網傳「登革熱噴藥會毒死人、可拒絕開門」為錯誤訊息",
        "summary": "網傳登革熱噴藥會毒死人、可拒絕開門配合為錯誤訊息。防治用藥經核准、依規定稀釋，配合孳生源清除與噴藥是傳染病防治法規定的義務。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/news/2025-07-15-clarify-dengue-spray/",
        "path": "/news/2025-07-15-clarify-dengue-spray/",
        "reviewedAt": "2025-07-15",
        "owner": "unit.pr",
        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "current",
        "whitelist": true
      },
      {
        "id": "clar.2025-04-mmr-born-after-1981-only",
        "type": "clarification",
        "title": "網傳「MMR 只有 1981 年後出生的人要補打」",
        "summary": "「只有 1981 年後出生要補打 MMR」為舊版建議；2025-04-16 修訂後，1966 年（含）以後出生不具免疫力者亦應評估。",
        "url": "https://ancientsky.github.io/new_cdc_prototype/preview/pr-56/factcheck/#clar.2025-04-mmr-born-after-1981-only",
        "path": "/factcheck/#clar.2025-04-mmr-born-after-1981-only",
        "reviewedAt": "2025-04-10",
        "owner": "unit.pr",
        "ownerName": "公關室",
        "lifecycle": "overdue",
        "whitelist": false
      }
